ne, lacks the retractable gear and extra power of the later RG. Sonny graciously granted me permission to deviate from his non-modification license and to base my RG upon his B model. I deeply appreciate this and stress that credit for the foundation airframe and its modeling belong to Sonny; his is really well done. I encourage you to fly his plane as well.","topics":[],"score":172572,"global_rank":430766},{"name":"edyoung/outwebview","owner":"edyoung","html_url":"https://github.com/edyoung/outwebview","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Experiment to build PowerShell out-gridview replacement in HTML","topics":[],"score":172572,"global_rank":430767},{"name":"leul7/WindowMaster","owner":"leul7","html_url":"https://github.com/leul7/WindowMaster","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"The purpose of this program is to calculate the total cost for home  replacement windows based on the following requirement.","topics":[],"score":172565,"global_rank":430768},{"name":"perompen/perom-pen-10.1.1-learning-contract","owner":"perompen","html_url":"https://github.com/perompen/perom-pen-10.1.1-learning-contract","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172565,"global_rank":430769},{"name":"JakeSquier/Pathing-Visualizer","owner":"JakeSquier","html_url":"https://github.com/JakeSquier/Pathing-Visualizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172565,"global_rank":430770},{"name":"mtimkovich/Paste-Bucket","owner":"mtimkovich","html_url":"https://github.com/mtimkovich/Paste-Bucket","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":"A pastebin clone","topics":[],"score":172563,"global_rank":430771},{"name":"hankyates/myvimrc","owner":"hankyates","html_url":"https://github.com/hankyates/myvimrc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"VimL","d